WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.879
Today we will revise a work thoughtfully. Our work connects with our own local

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:05.213
community.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:09.169
Read or listen to one helpful comment on the draft.

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.956
Choose one change that supports the artwork’s purpose.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:17.255
Make the change and explain how the second version improved.
